<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>ElevateU | Student Intelligence Lab</title>

<style>

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

:root{
    --bg:#07131d;
    --panel:#0d202e;
    --panel2:#10293a;
    --panel3:#132f42;
    --cream:#f5ecd9;
    --muted:#aebbc4;
    --gold:#e4c477;
    --cyan:#65d8e8;
    --green:#73d6a1;
    --red:#e98b8b;
    --blue:#76aef2;
    --line:rgba(255,255,255,.09);
}

html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 0%,rgba(101,216,232,.09),transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 5%,rgba(228,196,119,.08),transparent 30%),
        var(--bg);
    color:var(--cream);
    font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
    line-height:1.6;
}

.container{
    width:min(1450px,92%);
    margin:auto;
}

/* HEADER */

header{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    z-index:100;
    background:rgba(7,19,29,.94);
    backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}

.header-inner{
    min-height:70px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:20px;
}

.logo{
    font-size:1.35rem;
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:-.03em;
}

.logo span{
    color:var(--gold);
}

nav{
    display:flex;
    gap:6px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
}

nav a{
    color:var(--muted);
    text-decoration:none;
    padding:9px 12px;
    border-radius:9px;
    font-size:.82rem;
}

nav a:hover{
    background:var(--panel2);
    color:var(--cream);
}

/* HERO */

.hero{
    padding:85px 0 70px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}

.eyebrow{
    color:var(--gold);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.18em;
    font-size:.7rem;
    font-weight:900;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.hero-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.5fr .8fr;
    gap:50px;
    align-items:end;
}

.hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,6.2rem);
    line-height:.94;
    letter-spacing:-.06em;
    max-width:1000px;
}

.hero h1 span{
    color:var(--cyan);
}

.hero-copy{
    margin-top:25px;
    color:var(--muted);
    max-width:800px;
    font-size:1.08rem;
}

.hero-card{
    background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--panel2),var(--panel));
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:24px;
    padding:26px;
}

.hero-card .number{
    font-size:3rem;
    font-weight:900;
    color:var(--gold);
}

.hero-card p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.86rem;
}

/* INTRO */

.intro{
    padding:50px 0 20px;
}

.intro-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:16px;
}

.intro-card{
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--panel);
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:22px;
}

.intro-card strong{
    display:block;
    color:var(--cyan);
    margin-bottom:7px;
}

.intro-card p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.87rem;
}

/* SECTION */

section.lab{
    padding:45px 0;
}

.section-heading{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:end;
    gap:20px;
    margin-bottom:22px;
}

.section-heading h2{
    font-size:1.7rem;
}

.section-number{
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:.68rem;
    letter-spacing:.15em;
    font-weight:900;
    margin-bottom:5px;
}

.section-heading p{
    color:var(--muted);
    max-width:650px;
    font-size:.85rem;
}

/* BUTTONS */

button{
    border:0;
    cursor:pointer;
    font:inherit;
}

.btn{
    padding:11px 16px;
    border-radius:10px;
    font-weight:800;
    font-size:.82rem;
    transition:.2s;
}

.btn:hover{
    transform:translateY(-2px);
    filter:brightness(1.08);
}

.primary{
    background:var(--cyan);
    color:#061018;
}

.secondary{
    background:var(--panel3);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    color:var(--cream);
}

.gold{
    background:var(--gold);
    color:#15130c;
}

/* DECISION LAB */

.decision-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:18px;
}

.panel{
    background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--panel),#091923);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:25px;
}

.panel h3{
    margin-bottom:8px;
}

.panel-description{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.86rem;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.choice-grid{
    display:grid;
    gap:10px;
}

.choice{
    padding:16px;
    background:#081722;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:13px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:.2s;
}

.choice:hover{
    border-color:var(--cyan);
}

.choice.selected{
    border-color:var(--cyan);
    background:#102b39;
}

.choice strong{
    display:block;
}

.choice span{
    display:block;
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.76rem;
}

.result-box{
    margin-top:18px;
    padding:18px;
    background:#081722;
    border-radius:13px;
    border-left:3px solid var(--gold);
}

.result-box strong{
    color:var(--gold);
}

.result-box p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.84rem;
    margin-top:5px;
}

/* SCORE */

.score-row{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 70px;
    gap:15px;
    align-items:center;
    margin:16px 0;
}

.score-label{
    font-size:.8rem;
    color:var(--muted);
}

.score-bar{
    height:8px;
    background:#07131d;
    border-radius:99px;
    overflow:hidden;
    margin-top:7px;
}

.score-fill{
    height:100%;
    width:0;
    background:var(--cyan);
    transition:.6s;
}

.score-value{
    text-align:right;
    color:var(--gold);
    font-weight:900;
}

/* BIAS LAB */

.bias-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:15px;
}

.bias-card{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:17px;
    padding:21px;
}

.bias-card .label{
    color:var(--gold);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.1em;
    font-size:.62rem;
    font-weight:900;
}

.bias-card h3{
    margin:9px 0;
}

.bias-card p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.83rem;
}

.bias-card button{
    margin-top:17px;
}

/* CASE STUDIES */

.case-layout{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;
    gap:18px;
}

.case-list{
    display:grid;
    gap:10px;
}

.case-option{
    background:#081722;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:15px;
    cursor:pointer;
}

.case-option:hover{
    border-color:var(--cyan);
}

.case-option strong{
    display:block;
}

.case-option span{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.74rem;
}

.case-story{
    background:linear-gradient(145deg,#102b3b,#0b1d29);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:28px;
}

.case-story h3{
    color:var(--cyan);
    font-size:1.35rem;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.case-story p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.88rem;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.case-question{
    padding:17px;
    border:1px solid rgba(228,196,119,.25);
    background:rgba(228,196,119,.05);
    border-radius:13px;
}

.case-question strong{
    color:var(--gold);
}

/* ECONOMICS */

.economics-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:18px;
}

.input-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:12px;
}

.field label{
    display:block;
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.68rem;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.1em;
    font-weight:900;
    margin-bottom:6px;
}

input,select{
    width:100%;
    background:#071722;
    color:var(--cream);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:12px;
    border-radius:9px;
    outline:none;
}

input:focus,select:focus{
    border-color:var(--cyan);
}

.metric{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:13px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}

.metric:last-child{
    border-bottom:0;
}

.metric span{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.8rem;
}

.metric strong{
    color:var(--cream);
}

/* CHART */

.chart-wrap{
    margin-top:20px;
    height:260px;
    position:relative;
}

canvas{
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
}

/* LEARNING SCIENCE */

.learning-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:14px;
}

.learning-card{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:21px;
}

.learning-card .icon{
    font-size:1.5rem;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.learning-card h3{
    font-size:1rem;
    margin-bottom:7px;
}

.learning-card p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.8rem;
}

/* DIALOGUE */

.dialogue{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap:18px;
}

.dialogue-controls{
    display:grid;
    gap:9px;
}

.dialogue-controls button{
    text-align:left;
    padding:14px;
    background:#081722;
    color:var(--cream);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
}

.dialogue-controls button.active{
    border-color:var(--cyan);
}

.dialogue-box{
    background:#0b1d2a;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:25px;
}

.speaker{
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:.7rem;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.12em;
    font-weight:900;
}

.dialogue-box blockquote{
    margin:12px 0 20px;
    font-size:1.15rem;
    line-height:1.5;
}

.analysis{
    padding:16px;
    background:#071722;
    border-radius:12px;
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.83rem;
}

/* RESEARCH FACTS */

.fact-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:15px;
}

.fact{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:22px;
    border-radius:16px;
}

.fact-number{
    color:var(--cyan);
    font-size:2rem;
    font-weight:900;
}

.fact h3{
    margin:5px 0;
}

.fact p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.8rem;
}

/* PROGRESS */

.progress-panel{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#102c3b,#0c1d29);
    border:1px solid rgba(101,216,232,.2);
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:28px;
}

.progress-top{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:20px;
}

.level{
    color:var(--gold);
    font-weight:900;
}

.xp{
    color:var(--cyan);
    font-size:1.5rem;
    font-weight:900;
}

.progress-bar{
    height:10px;
    background:#07131d;
    border-radius:99px;
    margin-top:17px;
    overflow:hidden;
}

.progress-fill{
    height:100%;
    width:0;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cyan),var(--gold));
    transition:.5s;
}

/* FOOTER */

footer{
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:50px 0;
    color:var(--muted);
    text-align:center;
    font-size:.8rem;
}

/* RESPONSIVE */

@media(max-width:1050px){

    .hero-grid,
    .case-layout,
    .economics-grid,
    .decision-grid,
    .dialogue{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .learning-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    }

    .bias-grid,
    .fact-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    }
}

@media(max-width:700px){

    nav{
        display:none;
    }

    .hero{
        padding:55px 0;
    }

    .intro-grid,
    .bias-grid,
    .fact-grid,
    .learning-grid,
    .input-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .hero h1{
        font-size:3rem;
    }

    .section-heading{
        display:block;
    }
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<header>
<div class="container header-inner">

<div class="logo">
Elevate<span>U</span>
</div>

<nav>
<a href="#decision">Decision Lab</a>
<a href="#bias">Bias Lab</a>
<a href="#cases">Cases</a>
<a href="#economics">Economics</a>
<a href="#learning">Learning Science</a>
<a href="#research">Research</a>
</nav>

</div>
</header>

<!-- HERO -->

<section class="hero">

<div class="container hero-grid">

<div>

<div class="eyebrow">
Student Intelligence Lab
</div>

<h1>
Learn things that make you
<span>harder to replace.</span>
</h1>

<p class="hero-copy">
Most education teaches students what to know. ElevateU focuses on
how to think: opportunity cost, incentives, decision quality,
learning science, career economics, cognitive bias, strategic
tradeoffs and the hidden systems that influence outcomes.
</p>

</div>

<div class="hero-card">

<div class="number" id="xpHero">0</div>

<strong>Intelligence XP</strong>

<p>
Earn XP by completing simulations, analyzing cases and testing
your understanding.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- ORIENTATION -->

<section class="intro">

<div class="container">

<div class="intro-grid">

<div class="intro-card">
<strong>01 — Think in Systems</strong>
<p>
Learn to identify incentives, constraints, feedback loops and
second-order effects instead of looking only at immediate outcomes.
</p>
</div>

<div class="intro-card">
<strong>02 — Make Better Decisions</strong>
<p>
Separate a good decision from a good outcome. Analyze choices
before luck and hindsight distort your judgment.
</p>
</div>

<div class="intro-card">
<strong>03 — Build Transferable Intelligence</strong>
<p>
The objective is not memorization. It is being able to use an idea
in a new situation.
</p>
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- DECISION LAB -->

<section class="lab" id="decision">

<div class="container">

<div class="section-heading">

<div>
<div class="section-number">01 / DECISION INTELLIGENCE</div>
<h2>The Opportunity Cost Lab</h2>
</div>

<p>
Every choice spends scarce resources. Time spent on one path cannot
simultaneously be spent on another.
</p>

</div>

<div class="decision-grid">

<div class="panel">

<h3>You have 10 hours this week.</h3>

<p class="panel-description">
Choose the strategy you believe creates the strongest long-term
position.
</p>

<div class="choice-grid">

<div class="choice" onclick="chooseDecision(this,'credential')">
<strong>Earn a credential</strong>
<span>Increase formal signaling and structured knowledge.</span>
</div>

<div class="choice" onclick="chooseDecision(this,'project')">
<strong>Build a public project</strong>
<span>Create evidence that demonstrates ability.</span>
</div>

<div class="choice" onclick="chooseDecision(this,'network')">
<strong>Build relationships</strong>
<span>Increase access to people, information and opportunities.</span>
</div>

<div class="choice" onclick="chooseDecision(this,'income')">
<strong>Practice a monetizable skill</strong>
<span>Develop the ability to produce economic value.</span>
</div>

</div>

<div class="result-box" id="decisionResult">
<strong>Decision principle</strong>
<p>
There is no universally correct choice. The intelligent question is:
<strong>What constraint are you trying to remove?</strong>
</p>
</div>

</div>

<div class="panel">

<h3>Decision Quality Score</h3>

<p class="panel-description">
A useful decision considers more than immediate reward.
</p>

<div class="score-row">
<div>
<div class="score-label">Evidence</div>
<div class="score-bar"><div class="score-fill" id="evidenceBar"></div></div>
</div>
<div class="score-value" id="evidenceValue">0</div>
</div>

<div class="score-row">
<div>
<div class="score-label">Reversibility</div>
<div class="score-bar"><div class="score-fill" id="reverseBar"></div></div>
</div>
<div class="score-value" id="reverseValue">0</div>
</div>

<div class="score-row">
<div>
<div class="score-label">Upside</div>
<div class="score-bar"><div class="score-fill" id="upsideBar"></div></div>
</div>
<div class="score-value" id="upsideValue">0</div>
</div>

<div class="score-row">
<div>
<div class="score-label">Downside protection</div>
<div class="score-bar"><div class="score-fill" id="downsideBar"></div></div>
</div>
<div class="score-value" id="downsideValue">0</div>
</div>

<button class="btn secondary" onclick="scoreDecision()">
Evaluate My Decision
</button>

<div class="result-box" id="decisionScore">
<strong>Not evaluated</strong>
<p>
Choose an option, then evaluate the decision.
</p>
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- BIAS LAB -->

<section class="lab" id="bias">

<div class="container">

<div class="section-heading">

<div>
<div class="section-number">02 / COGNITIVE INTELLIGENCE</div>
<h2>Bias Detection Lab</h2>
</div>

<p>
Knowing cognitive biases is not enough. The valuable skill is noticing
when they are affecting your own reasoning.
</p>

</div>

<div class="bias-grid">

<div class="bias-card">

<div class="label">Bias 01</div>

<h3>Sunk Cost</h3>

<p>
Continuing because you already invested time, money or effort—even
when future costs exceed future benefits.
</p>

<button class="btn secondary" onclick="showBias('sunk')">
Test Yourself
</button>

</div>

<div class="bias-card">

<div class="label">Bias 02</div>

<h3>Confirmation Bias</h3>

<p>
Searching for or interpreting evidence in ways that reinforce what
you already believe.
</p>

<button class="btn secondary" onclick="showBias('confirmation')">
Test Yourself
</button>

</div>

<div class="bias-card">

<div class="label">Bias 03</div>

<h3>Present Bias</h3>

<p>
Giving disproportionate weight to immediate rewards compared with
larger future rewards.
</p>

<button class="btn secondary" onclick="showBias('present')">
Test Yourself
</button>

</div>

</div>

<div class="result-box" id="biasResult">

<strong>Bias challenge</strong>

<p>
Select a bias to receive a scenario that tests whether you can
recognize it in practice.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- CASE STUDIES -->

<section class="lab" id="cases">

<div class="container">

<div class="section-heading">

<div>
<div class="section-number">03 / STRATEGIC CASE STUDIES</div>
<h2>What Would You Do?</h2>
</div>

<p>
Real intelligence develops when you have to make decisions with
incomplete information.
</p>

</div>

<div class="case-layout">

<div class="panel">

<h3>Select a case</h3>

<div class="case-list">

<div class="case-option" onclick="loadCase('degree')">
<strong>The Expensive Degree</strong>
<span>A student has a strong academic opportunity but substantial debt.</span>
</div>

<div class="case-option" onclick="loadCase('startup')">
<strong>The Startup Trap</strong>
<span>A student has an exciting idea but no evidence of demand.</span>
</div>

<div class="case-option" onclick="loadCase('career')">
<strong>The High-Paying Job</strong>
<span>A student receives two offers with very different learning curves.</span>
</div>

<div class="case-option" onclick="loadCase('skill')">
<strong>The Skill Bet</strong>
<span>A student must decide which skill to develop before technology changes.</span>
</div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="case-story" id="caseStory">

<h3>Select a case study</h3>

<p>
Choose one of the scenarios. You will receive the situation,
strategic tension and the question an intelligent decision-maker
should ask.
</p>

<div class="case-question">
<strong>Core principle</strong>
<p>
The goal is not predicting the future perfectly. The goal is making
a robust decision despite uncertainty.
</p>
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- ECONOMICS -->

<section class="lab" id="economics">

<div class="container">

<div class="section-heading">

<div>
<div class="section-number">04 / CAREER ECONOMICS</div>
<h2>Human Capital Calculator</h2>
</div>

<p>
A career decision is an investment decision. Compare learning,
income, time and opportunity cost rather than looking at salary alone.
</p>

</div>

<div class="economics-grid">

<div class="panel">

<h3>Your assumptions</h3>

<div class="input-grid">

<div class="field">
<label>Current hourly value</label>
<input id="currentRate" type="number" value="15">
</div>

<div class="field">
<label>Future hourly value</label>
<input id="futureRate" type="number" value="30">
</div>

<div class="field">
<label>Learning hours / week</label>
<input id="learningHours" type="number" value="8">
</div>

<div class="field">
<label>Weeks per year</label>
<input id="weeks" type="number" value="48">
</div>

</div>

<button class="btn primary" style="margin-top:18px;" onclick="calculateHumanCapital()">
Calculate
</button>

<div class="chart-wrap">
<canvas id="incomeChart"></canvas>
</div>

</div>

<div class="panel">

<h3>What the numbers mean</h3>

<div class="metric">
<span>Annual value at current rate</span>
